BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 711.0 Td (There is no fee to apply. Any premium or contribution is only what is stated under What it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 697.0 Td (gives. Never pay anyone or share an OTP to apply.) Tj ET
